
---
import BaseLayout from '../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Workouts | Silken Valley Lifestyle"
  heroTitle="Workouts"
  heroText="Exercise routines, strength training, and inspiration for an active lifestyle."
  heroCompact={true}
>
  <section class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Fitness & Active Living</p>
    <h1>Workouts & Exercise Routines</h1>
    <p>
      Discover practical workout ideas, exercise routines,
      strength-building activities, and ways to incorporate
      regular movement into your everyday life.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="grid">
    <a class="card" href="/fitness/workouts/strength-training/">
      <h3>Strength Training</h3>
      <p>Build strength through resistance exercises and structured routines.</p>
    </a>

    <a class="card" href="/fitness/workouts/cardio/">
      <h3>Cardio Workouts</h3>
      <p>Improve cardiovascular fitness and endurance.</p>
    </a>

    <a class="card" href="/fitness/workouts/home-workouts/">
      <h3>Home Workouts</h3>
      <p>Convenient exercise routines you can do at home.</p>
    </a>

    <a class="card" href="/fitness/workouts/low-impact/">
      <h3>Low-Impact Exercise</h3>
      <p>Gentle movement and exercise with reduced joint impact.</p>
    </a>
  </section>

  <section class="latest">
    <h2>Building a Consistent Fitness Routine</h2>
    <p>
      A balanced fitness routine combines regular movement,
      appropriate exercise intensity, rest, and recovery.
      Explore different activities and develop habits that
      support long-term health and physical wellbeing.
    </p>
  </section>

  <p><a href="/fitness/">← Return to Fitness</a></p>
</BaseLayout>
